OL,3,GNEWSACold weather payments extended to
OL,4,A105 more homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe current payments are available to
OL,7,Fthose with a child under three years
OL,8,Fold, over 65s, people receiving level
OL,9,Fthree personal care support, receiving
OL,10,Fchild personal care at level three or
OL,11,Freceiving 100% long-term incapacity
OL,12,Fallowance.
